caption: Mastery Requirements
tradition-component: mastery-requirements

Spawn Mastery requires at least 100 character points total invested after modifiers in Spawn traits, consequential use of at least one Gift Trait rooted in an Eldritch Gift as a Spawn Power Stunt source, permanent purchase and consequential use of at least one derived Spawn Trait, consequential use of at least one Growth-Axis or other Root Trait, and a source-defining deed demonstrating that the character has become something their original Species could not have been without Eldritch Gifts. Attributes and Talents do not count toward this investment.
